      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors found pulp stones in more teeth of a 12-years-old girl. The present work discusses the concerning literature and it establishes that these stones are traced back to different aetiological factors. Their role in the toothaces without caries and presence impeding at root treatment is also emphasized."},
